    "description": "### Impact\nFix HTML injection in `PrettyText.format_for_email` caused by reparsing cooked attribute values as markup. Build Vimeo anchors and secure-upload notices with Nokogiri node APIs so that decoded attribute text is never reinterpreted as HTML. Validate Vimeo iframe host and path to prevent non-Vimeo allowlisted iframes from being incorrectly converted. Apply the same safe-pattern to hashtag-to-plaintext replacement and constrain secure-upload dimensions to numeric values.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
